How to approach each project

For every exercise, use the same learning cycle:

1. Build the simplest version
        ↓
2. Test with 3–5 inputs
        ↓
3. Print intermediate results
        ↓
4. Understand what LangChain is doing
        ↓
5. Add one improvement
        ↓
6. Convert it into an Agent/LangGraph workflow

For example, your Calculator Agent should evolve like this:

Version 1
calculate()


      ↓


Version 2
model.bind_tools()


      ↓


Version 3
manual tool execution


      ↓


Version 4
create_agent()


      ↓


Version 5
LangGraph


      ↓


Version 6
multiple tools + conditional routing